draft.prompt:
Write a professional self-assessment for {candidate_name}, a {current_role} with {years_exp} years of experience.

Skills: {skills}
Work style: {work_style}
Achievements:
- {achievement_1}
- {achievement_2}
- {achievement_3}

Produce:
1. PROFESSIONAL SUMMARY — 3 sentences capturing who they are and what they bring
2. CORE STRENGTHS — 4 bullet points
3. NOTABLE ACHIEVEMENTS — the 3 achievements rewritten as punchy, metric-driven bullets
4. WORK STYLE — 2 sentences on how they operate
